     "text": "The methods described here are intentionally simple. They rely on careful counting and on\nrepeated observation under controlled conditions. Readers familiar with modern statistics may\nfind the presentation elementary; this is by design, to keep the reasoning transparent from first\nprinciples rather than buried behind machinery.",
